      "floor": {
        "amount": 1800,
        "appliesTo": "Basic monthly salary, Singapore community care and support roles",
        "source": "JTE, November 2026",
        "short": "Care jobs pay by level, not one fixed salary. Care staff starts around S$2,500.",
        "long": "Care jobs pay by level. The lowest, a health attendant, starts at S$1,800. A healthcare assistant or care staff job starts around S$2,500 and goes up to about S$3,200. Those are basic salaries, so overtime and shift allowances are on top. Nursing is the one to watch. Those starting salaries are real, but they are not what gets a nurse to say yes. A clinic assistant already starts above S$2,500, and a nurse does much more than that. Budget a starting gross salary of about S$3,000 or the job will stay open.",
        "displayAmount": 2500
      },
      "note": "Salary here depends on the level of the job, more than on years of experience. Tell us the duties and how much supervision is involved, and we will tell you the level."
